# The ResQRoad server the app connects to by default while developing with
# `npx expo start`. Use your laptop's server (the address `npm start` prints)
# so test data stays off the live site; the APK uses the hosted copy,
# https://resqroad.onrender.com (see eas.json). People can change it under
# "Server settings" on the sign-in screen. Copy this file to .env.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.15:8000
